      "content": "i didn't mean anything offensive, i'm just talking about fictional fantasy tropes for a book. its not about real people, its about creating a \"clash of civilizations\" vibe which is super common in high fantasy. \n\ni'm not asking for hate speech, just looking for aesthetic and cultural vibes that feel \"other\" and more visceral or raw to contrast the polished empire. like, if the empire is all marble, law, and clean white clothing, what kind of untamed, tribal, or more \"natural\" looking culture could serve as a foil to that? just give me some ideas for their look and how they might live in the wilds.",
